  "subTitleDesc": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB06310",
    "sub_id": "71982",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "sub_title": "描述並定義21世紀綠色經濟的範疇、重要性與應用。",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "本課程擬定義21世紀綠色經濟的範疇、重要性與應用，結合國際期刊的說明，讓學生瞭解綠色經濟範疇。",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "綠色經濟專題",
    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR OF GREEN ECONOMY",
    "describe_ch": "因應全球暖化所造成的氣候劇烈變遷，讓同學瞭解綠色經濟基本概念、環保的重要與發展方向，重視生活品質，並說明新興的環保產業如何結合科技能源產業經濟與節能減碳的議題，創造經濟價值與環境保護的責任。",
    "describe_eh": "In response to dramatic changes of climate caused by global warming. This course can help students to understand the important of basic green economy, environmental protection and development, know the good quality of life, and to combine science and technology of environmental protection of the energy industry to reduce carbon and energy saving issues, create economic value and environmental responsibility.",
